  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "伪《列子》中有一段梦的叙述，极为精彩：",
      "output_sha256": "87b05ff3ec2076a32b652c3518e0897778398b0297b8e4fdf6fc1703b3a6fe7b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.494762,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f23850579806366c7a569348f09e96cbbbe88bc1d7fec44793f5ded26fd69e66"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "87b05ff3ec2076a32b652c3518e0897778398b0297b8e4fdf6fc1703b3a6fe7b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“周朝的尹氏治理国家，其下的劳工们日夜不停地工作。",
      "output_sha256": "b892d8eabe50550f72f65677cd0673ab34e002e4224a09e430621ce65d7cca8b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.362803,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "475a38698f341d961acc46a91117947440d5d066846c48ee3a50303c5bd3af4b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b892d8eabe50550f72f65677cd0673ab34e002e4224a09e430621ce65d7cca8b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有老役夫筋力竭矣，而使之弥勤。",
      "output_sha256": "9a65afc0c9ede9ac9a2b7b73caba431bc05d331a1e937c5fadb50a7a8e28a413",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "9a65afc0c9ede9ac9a2b7b73caba431bc05d331a1e937c5fadb50a7a8e28a413",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "昼则呻呼而即事，夜则昏惫而熟寐。",
      "output_sha256": "f4049a059d666e2bf2ffb33c7957a7c0582f125fb2efed31dd45b939cd13bbe9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "f4049a059d666e2bf2ffb33c7957a7c0582f125fb2efed31dd45b939cd13bbe9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "精神荒散，昔昔梦为国君：居人民之上，总一国之事；游燕宫观，恣意所欲，其乐无比。",
      "output_sha256": "a096e168bf8fef971f32008ce8b6a57d4626de2cf37227125c1dea79eae51492",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "a096e168bf8fef971f32008ce8b6a57d4626de2cf37227125c1dea79eae51492",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "觉则复役人。",
      "output_sha256": "4dda0df0c1200c4088ff148374b1d28656001862eb335d0d244f6f2481f0db3c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "4dda0df0c1200c4088ff148374b1d28656001862eb335d0d244f6f2481f0db3c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "……尹氏心营世事，虑钟家业，心形俱疲，夜亦昏惫而寐。",
      "output_sha256": "3dc1afe64faa9a14d29237c748a8f1a2db6c5db1c282eb0fa5702325d9cdf84b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "3dc1afe64faa9a14d29237c748a8f1a2db6c5db1c282eb0fa5702325d9cdf84b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "曾经梦见自己成为仆人：奔走劳碌，事无大小皆为所做；遭受责骂，无法逃避。",
      "output_sha256": "f7e6ae7f436479e73ecdd4e4c56d5ab01300f91611fd8758249d36de7dd0f0d3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.310128,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8,
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "29f825d6e1781d6a9eca280f4ba4c1f7e28ed75bc481e8f772ad54a9db6fbed4",
        "d4ed9cb01f73845b6801a1740d71535ea782c87c5b5235714211454c3d432f1c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f7e6ae7f436479e73ecdd4e4c56d5ab01300f91611fd8758249d36de7dd0f0d3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "眠中啽呓呻呼，彻旦息焉。",
      "output_sha256": "cf677c9416d4807fb27c665928234ffe31ec652f9bdd0eae778446a9f24b7410",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "cf677c9416d4807fb27c665928234ffe31ec652f9bdd0eae778446a9f24b7410",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "……”",
      "output_sha256": "62c54477d5f4b758b352528e545dc631462c65847edf4a2c7a993c4846b93aa6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "62c54477d5f4b758b352528e545dc631462c65847edf4a2c7a993c4846b93aa6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "此文原意是要说出“苦逸之复，数之常也；若欲觉梦兼之，岂可得邪？”",
      "output_sha256": "1f28b507d0966464306fe61e7f8faa50c9e2f9d097ae32579fed48cef1b95602",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "1f28b507d0966464306fe61e7f8faa50c9e2f9d097ae32579fed48cef1b95602",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "其中蕴含的深意，我尚未完全领悟；我只是片面的欣赏这个故事，因此引述于此。",
      "output_sha256": "bee6173f574b2495f1d5ebe55f57cc789467678a5107c3bfcf0c152403d7e2b1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.335933,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b5cff2c6048aea65e0e649e18bac42789b50f20e329e08a91c1f2c4c2ee95d2d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bee6173f574b2495f1d5ebe55f57cc789467678a5107c3bfcf0c152403d7e2b1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我只觉得梦不是一件坯东西。",
      "output_sha256": "f2b00fb9ce163aee4ac78d24d8370ba04e6ae9b662bd0552b51024abbb8b4d68",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "f2b00fb9ce163aee4ac78d24d8370ba04e6ae9b662bd0552b51024abbb8b4d68",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "即真如这件故事所说，也还是很有意思的。",
      "output_sha256": "a3ff1e6a5ec6119bc54e380838efd1d94d05cd2f994415cecc06dc73a6348bb6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "a3ff1e6a5ec6119bc54e380838efd1d94d05cd2f994415cecc06dc73a6348bb6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "人生有限，若我们每晚都能拥有如此清晰的梦境，日复一日，便能以一日抵过两日；过了五十年，便相当于一百年。",
      "output_sha256": "13077bc88ab9c21956ad19719f3bbc0a7d2be02534fc6040955c404b7f178eee",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.490216,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "965b01ddc92f31644cff299a54d0328f04c2ce7a3382c4fe59521bb002d773b0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "13077bc88ab9c21956ad19719f3bbc0a7d2be02534fc6040955c404b7f178eee",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15,
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "如此美好的事情，实在是难得的。",
      "output_sha256": "584fcbdb3e3eab7d6855409e0bbb3321487cd315cd162f1e19a3755c41ba88c0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.490216,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "965b01ddc92f31644cff299a54d0328f04c2ce7a3382c4fe59521bb002d773b0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "584fcbdb3e3eab7d6855409e0bbb3321487cd315cd162f1e19a3755c41ba88c0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15,
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "至于梦中的“苦乐”，则照我素人的见解，毕竟是“梦中的”苦乐，不必斤斤计较的。",
      "output_sha256": "32b95442314c18aabb9bb4cb8e4b7e82055a3cae1b74f6f368a1ff090044eba8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "32b95442314c18aabb9bb4cb8e4b7e82055a3cae1b74f6f368a1ff090044eba8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "若必欲斤斤计较，我要大胆地说一句：他和那些在墙上贴红纸条儿，写著“夜梦不祥，书破大吉”的，同样地不懂得梦！",
      "output_sha256": "c0928c692533ba8314f126ebd7dabb2f6898fb0b548da172c8dfdc04e7214f53",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "c0928c692533ba8314f126ebd7dabb2f6898fb0b548da172c8dfdc04e7214f53",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "庄子曾说，“至人无梦。”",
      "output_sha256": "d6b9b8abb6ee09381843baa96925c08e5d76c2347abf0f8b2c0ec10c50145baa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.682457,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "25a2fcf133c770c4089dee6c9cc2f4b1afc505215ad8f6e2fd224424db149405"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d6b9b8abb6ee09381843baa96925c08e5d76c2347abf0f8b2c0ec10c50145baa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "伪《列子》也提到，“古之真人，觉自忘，寝则无梦。”",
      "output_sha256": "acdb5fac14b80c925a39ae35005462571a979f86975bd976a03e886a3edba047",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": 0.606725,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8be21321f4c876cd680993f6182c5d4417670f3b362201f8f9aa72663751a0f6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "acdb5fac14b80c925a39ae35005462571a979f86975bd976a03e886a3edba047",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "——张湛注释道，“真人无往不忘，理应不眠，何来梦境？”",
      "output_sha256": "ea28f5f2374298bb28d8bcb2c30d277b9c94248864f0cccb1a99a7cebd4b17d5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.634536,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "de94d37929204832225716a18e71f7fef620c77172da58260f497c9f7d360e4b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ea28f5f2374298bb28d8bcb2c30d277b9c94248864f0cccb1a99a7cebd4b17d5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可知我们这几位先哲不甚以做梦为然，至少也总以为梦是不大高明的东西。",
      "output_sha256": "6a7ef8b53aaf0bacafb07c68a7bbeeb38f078ed0e884330133fa41e50d413490",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "6a7ef8b53aaf0bacafb07c68a7bbeeb38f078ed0e884330133fa41e50d413490",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但孔子就与他们不同，他深以“不复梦见周公”为憾；他自然是爱做梦的，至少也是不反对做梦的。",
      "output_sha256": "29b8e44c9d65d6a1a0f94621a962d6650068a4aa921a7d66e325e4ec0f6c3d63",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "29b8e44c9d65d6a1a0f94621a962d6650068a4aa921a7d66e325e4ec0f6c3d63",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "——殆所谓时乎做梦则做梦者欤？",
      "output_sha256": "1de80eb208ea326729ff87500e3b1ead2da76944efe7b7f6e1b0aa62ec9c2c52",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "1de80eb208ea326729ff87500e3b1ead2da76944efe7b7f6e1b0aa62ec9c2c52",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我觉得“至人”，“真人”，毕竟没有我们的份儿，我们大可不必妄想；只看“乃当不眠”一个条件，你我能做到么？",
      "output_sha256": "f695df9aaf4637563bb7247208b3da57794f06bba4e70f366a60e3e0af7ff447",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "f695df9aaf4637563bb7247208b3da57794f06bba4e70f366a60e3e0af7ff447",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "唉，你若主张或实行“八小时睡眠”，就别想做“至人”，“真人”了！",
      "output_sha256": "488c1896e348d8aa3f83376880b7bb2155b38de21da1c6804250b7380c5e1f11",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "488c1896e348d8aa3f83376880b7bb2155b38de21da1c6804250b7380c5e1f11",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但是，也不用担心，还有为我们掮木梢的：我们知道，愚人也无梦！",
      "output_sha256": "ea67ab599a85a7d1f6dfa54a42eded39cc1c72c3e710496152b40371b3c8b1c1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "ea67ab599a85a7d1f6dfa54a42eded39cc1c72c3e710496152b40371b3c8b1c1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他们是一枕黑甜，哼呵到晓，一些儿梦的影子也找不著的！",
      "output_sha256": "7d49570280ea0816e200ff7d604b33ec632eb27db051d196f232d2310f720d0a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "7d49570280ea0816e200ff7d604b33ec632eb27db051d196f232d2310f720d0a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们徼幸还会做几个梦，虽因此失了“至人”，“真人”的资格，却也因此而得免于愚人，未尝不是运气。",
      "output_sha256": "1bc2dda8c5500c9abcea458a87608ca6ab1d826455b24f5b8eeb71f01016306e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "1bc2dda8c5500c9abcea458a87608ca6ab1d826455b24f5b8eeb71f01016306e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "至于“至人”与“真人”之无梦与愚人之无梦，究竟有何差别？",
      "output_sha256": "a72c00672d88bb90bb4b08cac0fa4e3f4a91ee91d1fb928a4d689f3d54192438",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.770105,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fb2be1de690adc574898501c661e188ac83dd802c50e4fdb237249a9da6d64fb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a72c00672d88bb90bb4b08cac0fa4e3f4a91ee91d1fb928a4d689f3d54192438",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这确实是个难题。",
      "output_sha256": "8f51e7d557fc90a656c76d240008b9c72d30d0368bd1abd57615499a39036b82",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.540018,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5988d4e2128eebc9da1ffd9ccdfe18b506c3caa218d716f43294b07a809e2c71"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8f51e7d557fc90a656c76d240008b9c72d30d0368bd1abd57615499a39036b82",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我想偷懒，还是摭拾上文说过的话来答吧：“真人……乃当不眠，……”而愚人是“一枕黑甜，哼呵到晓”的！",
      "output_sha256": "6b3e692985a3acd21195694130b4f1d3b7e2b06935542429b28ee953d8fd960f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "6b3e692985a3acd21195694130b4f1d3b7e2b06935542429b28ee953d8fd960f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "再加一句，此即孔子所谓“上智与下愚不移”也。",
      "output_sha256": "4faf6dc87c87a3a3c996297e894a83f11e3380a1b68b34171e2267f6407eeeca",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "4faf6dc87c87a3a3c996297e894a83f11e3380a1b68b34171e2267f6407eeeca",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "说到孔子，孔子不反对做梦，难道也做不了“至人”，“真人”？",
      "output_sha256": "04f60202bf3f17a83eb6354c52b687b6e3fbac8068f3599e623915d29f5b890a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "04f60202bf3f17a83eb6354c52b687b6e3fbac8068f3599e623915d29f5b890a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我说，“唯唯，否否！”",
      "output_sha256": "25277b47f2c0b683875ab775c676ac3dbe52d4bd4e92cbdbfa7b9045a6e71c3d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "25277b47f2c0b683875ab775c676ac3dbe52d4bd4e92cbdbfa7b9045a6e71c3d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "孔子是“圣人”，自有其特殊地位，无需再争什么“至人”或“真人”的头衔。",
      "output_sha256": "2d87f30a1ccb9ca7e20382e7e8d5cc1ae1271ff64f6b1c9017f7c7c473fea08b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": 0.591202,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ab70d4ae5ab7f11bf02ea15db92c335333c003283e77b73dede76e315fa8b973"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2d87f30a1ccb9ca7e20382e7e8d5cc1ae1271ff64f6b1c9017f7c7c473fea08b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但得知道，做梦而能梦周公，才能成其所以为圣人；我们也还是够不上格儿的。",
      "output_sha256": "f492c2a5cb5849618107c45c2a4abbd5d4afd98eb1c5600b809a5ca530fb3ce7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "f492c2a5cb5849618107c45c2a4abbd5d4afd98eb1c5600b809a5ca530fb3ce7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们终于只能做第二流人物。",
      "output_sha256": "00e0629d6b6ce73c71e3b12fd4246c261ac672159aa697721543b0928912f912",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "00e0629d6b6ce73c71e3b12fd4246c261ac672159aa697721543b0928912f912",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但这中间也还有个高低。",
      "output_sha256": "458be4936eff3e65bf3dd9a6e7039cef18865e4d3a72fc3b918ad8e35f704656",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "458be4936eff3e65bf3dd9a6e7039cef18865e4d3a72fc3b918ad8e35f704656",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "高的如我的朋友Ｐ君：他梦见花，梦见诗，梦见绮丽的衣裳，……真可算得有梦皆甜了。",
      "output_sha256": "946428b5103217d3cb33ee009006fe5ce5a898d3027558eadc53997eacf27f34",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "946428b5103217d3cb33ee009006fe5ce5a898d3027558eadc53997eacf27f34",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "而我则相对低一些：在江南时，我本属愚人之列，习惯性地黑暗沉睡至天光；不过得说明，我是没有哼哼声的。",
      "output_sha256": "20405bad60a8065e91d7ab0d6802c62b419ca42796aee8d8c3efbccb7cccdcfd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.5008,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "68d39c90b06722333d85d0b3ec4dd487e50709076954eb96c99fe97084847b32"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_ai_sha256": "20405bad60a8065e91d7ab0d6802c62b419ca42796aee8d8c3efbccb7cccdcfd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "北来以后，不知怎样，陡然聪明起来，夜夜有梦，而且不一其梦。",
      "output_sha256": "05624f458fed50d4a4f53d8851807f6ce8730ec062a5e90e2208a1a22139886a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "05624f458fed50d4a4f53d8851807f6ce8730ec062a5e90e2208a1a22139886a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但我究竟是新升格的，梦尽管做，却做不著一个清清楚楚的梦！",
      "output_sha256": "ed0d75ba59f68181635977c42696a14e49f356500603145d3e719e8a0cc4562b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "ed0d75ba59f68181635977c42696a14e49f356500603145d3e719e8a0cc4562b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "整夜的梦境混乱无序，醒来时只感到头脑恍惚，似乎失去了一切。",
      "output_sha256": "a6c36bff2a25ddf7b72623b98c888c07c29d3f0acfcf7047b6f5251f34309b23",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.288851,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "80b9c1c335b82cbe1036e9844ac374716e832051589076c44f03dbed45ef9d7f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a6c36bff2a25ddf7b72623b98c888c07c29d3f0acfcf7047b6f5251f34309b23",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "最难堪的是每早将醒未醒之际，残梦依人，腻腻不去；忽然双眼一睁，如坠深谷，万象寂然——只有一角日光在墙上痴痴地等著！",
      "output_sha256": "1ea4da1569720629d101ce6fa8610522ee122f700c261a2aac7ff3a116e6c7a8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "1ea4da1569720629d101ce6fa8610522ee122f700c261a2aac7ff3a116e6c7a8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "此时我决不愿起身，必定专注思索，想要追回梦中的滋味；但往往无法想到，只是恍惚地怀念着什么而已。",
      "output_sha256": "c162ca00037c6ff32ad05bbd29706c140c6e9498b644a96c5da4cb2618889bf1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": 0.461855,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "553d26fa3ee120d156e081a958ee5b873d66f573035f90e09374c0e4a5aa38dc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c162ca00037c6ff32ad05bbd29706c140c6e9498b644a96c5da4cb2618889bf1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "尽管如此，我知道一点：梦中的世界是自由的，任你徜徉，任你翱翔；一旦睁眼，立刻被现实的束缚所缠绕，便大为不同了！",
      "output_sha256": "0d6d5d2b0c347fbd6b92baa76379b7a288a7e5817f6e80cac8e94acf67187118",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": 0.548044,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "420685e0c9ad4c6641e7fec4e253cbe825da33f7ed131ee66722fcd01e039fff"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0d6d5d2b0c347fbd6b92baa76379b7a288a7e5817f6e80cac8e94acf67187118",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "此刻我确实有些精神恍惚，所写之文已足以让你明白。",
      "output_sha256": "ecfebb10325cbb1d83106e721b863ac81b07ceb5b73b752f183d257cc28600df",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.5,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fcba2b81b519c670a34c32505bf4b0bf2cff7119eb973915a694bed7a02d86d5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ecfebb10325cbb1d83106e721b863ac81b07ceb5b73b752f183d257cc28600df",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但我不因此诅咒梦；我只怪我做梦的艺术不佳，做不著清楚的梦。",
      "output_sha256": "c51b67edde3e5d12bdc4a29ae99f7f24da3096531d75f3619df07ca23aa90406",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "c51b67edde3e5d12bdc4a29ae99f7f24da3096531d75f3619df07ca23aa90406",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "若做著清楚的梦，若夜夜做著清楚的梦，我想精神恍惚也无妨的。",
      "output_sha256": "9ce4ae9d871504621cca5f04e44d99ac577d48798040ada4faac2562bc3f4daf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "9ce4ae9d871504621cca5f04e44d99ac577d48798040ada4faac2562bc3f4daf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "眼下这一大串糊里糊涂的梦，简直要把这个“我”化成一团黑暗，实在有些不便。",
      "output_sha256": "ed177934c492c07ea17e2cb564a2df1ba6e0f035f845afaa9fa0255ddeecbf76",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": 0.611529,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "14c291466b603eafca0f6730d33fd8e33b6d55a944a7b0b7bee8e177bd9e7ff8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ed177934c492c07ea17e2cb564a2df1ba6e0f035f845afaa9fa0255ddeecbf76",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "是的，我得学些本事，今夜做他几个好好的梦。",
      "output_sha256": "63b0fba069d61078f8722336166dda8ff187f6683f476b89463a4ebb115db7c3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "63b0fba069d61078f8722336166dda8ff187f6683f476b89463a4ebb115db7c3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我是彻头彻尾赞美梦的，因为我是素人，而且将永远是素人。",
      "output_sha256": "d9aaac0c64258e3344416730476479f35a2ced096125ca3eaa28142a3bc35fec",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "d9aaac0c64258e3344416730476479f35a2ced096125ca3eaa28142a3bc35fec",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
